# Harness run artifacts. `out/` holds the containers' database volumes — a single
# run is ~2 GB and the OQ7 run reached 7.7 GB. The small, interesting products of
# a run (console logs, role timelines, apply-info samples) are committed by hand
# under harness/results/ instead.
out/
*.err
*.access
csql.err

.omc/

# build output
bin/
